OL,3,GNEWSADoctor in court accused of
OL,4,Asupporting Hamas
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS consultant neurologist accused
OL,7,Fof posting her support on social media
OL,8,Ffor the proscribed organisation Hamas
OL,9,Fhas appeared in court.
OL,11,FAppearing at Westminster Magistrates'
OL,12,FCourt, Dr Rehiana Ali, 46, from
OL,13,FBradford, was also accused of stirring
OL,14,Fup racial hatred.
OL,16,FThe hearing was told that Ali was
OL,17,Falleged to have shown support for Hamas
OL,18,Fin three posts on X and one WhatsApp
OL,19,Fmessage between October 2024 and March
OL,20,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
