OL,3,GNEWSADoctor in court accused of
OL,4,Asupporting Hamas
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe is charged with four offences of
OL,7,Fexpressing an opinion or belief in
OL,8,Fsupport of a proscribed organisation,
OL,9,Fas well as being reckless as to whether
OL,10,Fit would encourage support for Hamas.
